      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "现在是星期六下午五点，大星和他的女朋友在一个商店。",
      "traditional": "現在是星期六下午五點，大星和他的女朋友在一個商店。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài shì xīng qī liù xià wǔ wǔ diǎn dà xīng hé tā de nǚ péng you zài yí ge shāng diàn",
      "english": "It was five o’clock on a Saturday afternoon. Daxing and his girlfriend were in a store."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
