    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "商店里有很多猫，大星和他的女朋友都喜欢猫。",
      "traditional": "商店裡有很多貓，大星和他的女朋友都喜歡貓。",
      "pinyin": "shāng diàn lǐ yǒu hěn duō māo dà xīng hé tā de nǚ péng you dōu xǐ huan māo",
      "english": "There were a lot of cats in the store. Daxing and his girlfriend love cats."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "五点他们和猫玩；五点三十分，他们和猫玩；六点，他们和猫玩。",
      "traditional": "五點他們和貓玩；五點三十分，他們和貓玩；六點，他們和貓玩。",
      "pinyin": "wǔ diǎn tā men hé māo wán wǔ diǎn sān shí fēn tā men hé māo wán liù diǎn tā men hé māo wán",
      "english": "At five o’clock they played with cats. At 5:30, they played with cats. At six o’clock, they played with cats."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我在哪儿？我在大星的衣服里面。大星不看我，大星看他的女朋友。",
      "traditional": "我在哪兒？我在大星的衣服裡面。大星不看我，大星看他的女朋友。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zài nǎ'r wǒ zài dà xīng de yī fu lǐ miàn dà xīng bú kàn wǒ dà xīng kàn tā de nǚ péng you",
      "english": "Where was I? I was in Daxing’s clothes. Daxing didn’t look at me. Daxing was looking at his girlfriend."
    },
    {
